NOTE ON UNDERLYING MATHEMATICS:

This license covers the specific code, documentation, and construction
parameters in this repository. It does not and cannot cover the underlying
mathematical methods, which are public domain: the Siamese/De la Loubere
method (1688) and the general theory of magic hypercubes of arbitrary
dimension (existence proven and a general construction given by Marian
Trenkler; specific low-dimension hypercubes constructed earlier by
J.R. Hendricks). See METHODS.md for the full prior-art discussion.
